skip postgres: LIN_BENCH_SKIP_PG is set
skip mysql: LIN_BENCH_SKIP_MYSQL is set
lin compare: N=10000 warm reads (fixture), bulk insert (schema outside timing)
engines: Lin | SQLite(rusqlite bundled) | DuckDB(bundled) | HashMap(point get only) | Postgres(skipped) | MySQL(skipped)
airbug dash: http://127.0.0.1:8790/
Lin reads: prepare once / run many; filters use count (fair vs SQL COUNT(*));
substring: Lin `title ~ "wal" | count` vs SQL LIKE '%wal%' COUNT(*);
materialize: Lin `wing==rag | {id,title} | take all` vs SQL SELECT id,title;
join: 10000 orders ⋈ 1000 users (Lin run_batch SoA / cursor vs SQL INNER JOIN);
append_log: Lin `append facts` vs SQL INSERT INTO logs (append-only shape)
airbug dash: http://127.0.0.1:8790/#/bench
